  /// spec-8-3 — I/O matrix: "Tap away, not saving -> Reverts, draft
  /// discarded, no PATCH" / "Tap away, saving -> No-op, save completes".
  /// A no-op while [AccountSettingsState.isSavingName] (Boundaries) — the
